stateDiagram-v2
direction TB
[*] --> Detected: media URL extracted
Detected --> Unmatched: no filter matches
Detected --> Deferred: filter matched, task enqueued
Unmatched --> [*]: shown as posted
Deferred --> Generating: process_image_batch
Deferred --> Cached: cache hit
Generating --> Scoring: a candidate succeeded
Generating --> Failed: all candidates failed
Scoring --> Cached: finalize_workflow
Scoring --> Failed: all scoring failed
Cached --> Swapped: poll returns COMPLETED
Failed --> TimedOut: 20 polls or 160 s
Swapped --> [*]: transformed image shown
TimedOut --> [*]: original image stays
